 shaders, no canvas items, no meshes over the camera\r\n4. The darkening affects the main viewport of Godot engine.\r\n5. To reproduce, just use ANYTHING in 3D scene, meshes are also getting darker\r\n6. I was using ACES, but it can be reproduced with any mode\r\n7. I was using auto exposure, but on the shot below it's disabled\r\n\r\n### Here's linear colors mode in the ENV node + sphere with StandardMaterial3D\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d3b2bd75-4f7c-417b-b7f0-a1caca106f91)\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450873543/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2451016159","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98708#issuecomment-2451016159","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98708","id":2451016159,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SF4nf","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T23:30:20Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T23:30:41Z","body":"Thank you for your response! That really helps.\r\n\r\nOne more question:\r\n\r\nDid you restart the editor after turning on HDR 2D?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2451016159/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2451550331","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98708#issuecomment-2451550331","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98708","id":2451550331,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SH7B7","user":{"login":"ArseniyMirniy","id":19660324,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjYwMzI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19660324?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArseniyMirniy","html_url":"https://github.com/ArseniyMirniy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArseniyMirniy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArseniyMirniy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArseniyMirniy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArseniyMirniy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArseniyMirniy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArseniyMirniy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArseniyMirniy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArseniyMirniy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArseniyMirniy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-01T09:03:24Z","updated_at":"2024-11-01T09:15:32Z","body":"> Thank you for your response! That really helps.\r\n> \r\n> One more question:\r\n> \r\n> Did you restart the editor after turning on HDR 2D?\r\n\r\nYes, since to apply 2D HDR you have to click on [Save and Restart the Editor]","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2451550331/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2984511578","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98708#issuecomment-2984511578","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98708","id":2984511578,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6x5Aha","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T14:44:46Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T14:44:46Z","body":"I believe this issue is related to having the Environment set to use a Background of \"Clear Color\":\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a08ec31-57ed-4591-bba0-5f606b9e1297)\n\nIf I were to take a guess at the root issue here, I would say the sRGB vs. linear encoding of `rendering/environment/defaults/default_clear_color` is being incorrectly interpreted when HDR 2D is enabled. Specifically, it seems that the sRGB-encoded `Color` of Default Clear Color is being treated as if it's linear-encoded and is being converted to sRGB, meaning that the `linear_to_sRGB` function is being applied when it shouldn't be. If I'm correct, the fix to this issue would be to make `rendering/environment/defaults/default_clear_color` always be correctly interpreted as an sRGB-encoded `Color`, regardless of whether HDR 2D is enabled or not.\n\nAs stated in the comments, this is not specific to an HDR EXR image; any mesh will do. Here's a MRP for testing:\n\n[2D-HDR-ClearColor-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20798650/2D-HDR-ClearColor-bug.zip)\n\n| Environment Background Mode | HDR 2D Disabled | HDR 2D Enabled\n| --- | --- | ---\nClear Color | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee756940-8938-436e-b8ba-bc5ac8cd3178) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1435fccd-79fc-4330-95ee-c7c17b7d208e)\nCustom Color | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b784628a-3e1b-491e-8836-daa2636b904b) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ff7d431-7aae-43ef-b365-46f3e99eb24d)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2984511578/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3081950651","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98708#issuecomment-3081950651","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98708","id":3081950651,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63stW7","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T00:32:28Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T00:32:28Z","body":"To those subscribed to this thread, I’ve put together a fix that should fully resolve this issue: #108682 \n\nFeel free to try out the fix using the build artifacts on the Checks page of the PR and let me know if it resolves the issues for you.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3081950651/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]